      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要吃点脆脆腌菜，稍微休息一下吗？\n小火山的训练员也来吃吧，\n来，请慢用～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c8a0fab2811120b38000180d68f61feca9e79a9dde764bcc796f0ca07db22db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
