      "uid": "zhcn:c231dedf68c5ca2d8732fb47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这位让现场气氛瞬间缓和下来的赛马娘，\n名叫奇锐骏。\n虽然她仿佛散发着一种老奶奶的氛围──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f11894aa2c2a979fd72d936c665b3f7ca67fa291165549e0138071b882d599e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099100.json",
      "json_path": [
