      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对同样跑沙土的北港火山而言，\n她是一名将来可能会成为竞争对手，\n同时也能当成目标的选手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1a09b6fcac2e9fa074cf618dba2a99876deffc53786aec8ca3e22ac5c61af18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
