      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──那天训练结束后，\n北港火山带着似乎装着东西的纸箱\n来到训练员室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2defbdaf9d218359c95346c352f70fc77c6fb86ba313a821c4a009fc834862d",
